<script>_showOceanSlice = true;_disableStartLerp=true;_guest=true;shipStatus=0;</script>
<div id="background"></div>
<div id="varyingContents" class="hidden">
    <a href="https://hackclub.com" id="hackclub-flag"><img src="https://assets.hackclub.com/flag-orpheus-top.svg"></a>
    <div style="position: absolute;width:100%"><img id="logo" src="<%= asset_path("graphics/logo.svg") %>" alt="Out To C"></div>
    <%= image_tag "graphics/scroll.svg", id: "scroll-indicator" %>
    <a class="linkbutton sign-in" href="https://auth.hackclub.com/oauth/authorize?client_id=<%= ENV["HCA_CLIENT_ID"] %>&redirect_uri=<%= CGI.escape(auth_hca_callback_url) %>&response_type=code&scope=email+slack_id+openid+verification_status">
        Sign in with Hack Club
    </a>
    <% if Rails.env.development? %>
    <div class="devlogin">
        <span>Dev login:</span>
        <form action="/auth/dev">
            <input name="uid" type="text" placeholder="Enter UID for user">
        </form>
    </div>
    <% end %>

    <div class="ocean-gradient"></div>
    <div class="spacer"></div>
    <!-- text contents! -->
    <div class="container">
        <div class="centered">
        <main>
            <h1>Out To C</h1>
            <p>Voyage out to sea on the hunt for treasure! You write projects in C, C++ or C#, and while you work,
            your ship travels further and further. On the way, there's islands with treasure chests!</p>
        </main>
        <div class="card-holder">
            <%= image_tag("graphics/card1.svg") %>
            <%= image_tag("graphics/card2.svg") %>
            <%= image_tag("graphics/card3.svg") %>
        </div>
        <br>
        <span class="center" style="display:block">(try hovering the islands:)</span>
        <div class="map-holder">
            <% for mi in 0..4-1 %>
            <div class="map-marker" id="map-marker-<%= mi+1 %>">
                <div>
                    <div>
                    (Choose 1)
                    <div class="spread spread<%= @prices[mi].length %>">
                        <% for i in @prices[mi] %>
                        <img src="<%= asset_path("prices/#{i[0]}.png") %>" title="<%= i[1][:name] %>">
                        <% end %>
                    </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <% end %>
            <%= image_tag "graphics/map.svg", id: "map" %>
        </div>
        <h1>More information</h1>
        <p>There's islands with treasure that your ship reaches as you code. At each island, 
            you get to choose one out of several possible rewards, which is added to your ship's cargo.<br>
            When you're done with your project, you can ship [<span class="info-hover">?<span>Shipping means publishing/releasing your project.</span></span>] it, at which point you receive all
            the treasure you've gotten so far. </p>
        <span>Interested? Sign up now, and join the channel <a class="channel-link"
            href="https://hackclub.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C0ANHQPT1S4">#out-to-c</a>!</span>

        <hr>
        
        <details>
        <summary>When is this event running?</summary>
        <p>This YSWS is running from 14 Aug - 7 Sep (2026).</p>
        </details>

        <details>
        <summary>What is Hack Club?</summary>
        <p>Hack Club is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit, dedicated to getting teenagers into the world of tech! Hack Club runs events like this all the time, for teenagers, by teenagers!</p>
        </details>

        <details>
        <summary>Who can participate?</summary>
        <p>Anyone aged 13-18 can join! Its totally free and you get cool stuff! You don't need to know programming beforehand, you can learn during the event!</p>
        </details>

        <details>
        <summary>How does this work? How is time tracked?</summary>
        <p>This event uses <a style="color:white" target="_blank" href="https://hackatime.hackclub.com/">Hackatime</a> to track time spent in your code editor. There's hackatime extensions for all major code editors.</p>
        </details>
        
        <details>
        <summary>What prices can I get?</summary>
        <p>Try hovering the islands on the map above !!</p>
        </details>
        
        <div style="height:100px"></div>
        <div style="margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;width: fit-content;margin-top:45px;">
            <a class="linkbutton" href="https://auth.hackclub.com/oauth/authorize?client_id=<%= ENV["HCA_CLIENT_ID"] %>&redirect_uri=<%= CGI.escape(auth_hca_callback_url) %>&response_type=code&scope=email+slack_id+openid+verification_status">Sign in with Hack Club</a>
        </div>
        <div class="bottom">
            <p>Made by 
                <a class="channel-link" target="_blank" href="https://hackclub.enterprise.slack.com/team/U098P9DLUGJ">@iris</a>
                |
                <a class="channel-link" target="_blank" href="https://github.com/hackclub/out-to-c">Github Repo</a>
                |
                <a class="channel-link" target="_blank" href="https://hackclub.com/privacy-and-terms">Hack Club Privacy Policy</a></p>
                
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>